   "text": "Core idea is variation of explicit coordinate tokens explored elsewhere",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.3",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "No attention probing proving reference-and-adjust mechanism",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
